==English==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|la|en}} for “he is ill”, 3rd person singular form of the verb {{term|aegrotare}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[certificate]] indicating that a student is ill, excusing them from lectures and examinations and allowing them to pass courses for which they are too ill to finish the required materials.
# An unclassified [[degree]] awarded to such a student.

